{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"P I Meena","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/59tVNbN95XZXfSBbRdiDfgokKul.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3i0kxGWTL9SMdbfwg8M8UI3E6ex.jpg","description":"Haunted by flashes of a tragic past, a private investigator, Meenakshi Iyer, aka P.I. Meena, starts investigating what seems like a routine hit-and-run case, only to discover that there's more to it than meets the eye and becomes entangled in a web of conspiracy that is tearing apart the worlds of everyone who comes close to it.\n\nRated A · Returning Series · First aired 3 Nov 2023 · India · Language: Hindi\nStudio: QED Films · Network: Prime Video\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Crime","Mystery","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"The Sound of Metal","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A brutal road accident that kills a young man. When the man’s mother, Chandana, tells Meenakshi that it wasn’t an accident and requests her to investigate it, Meenakshi refuses saying PI’s have no business investigating murders. But can she stay away?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lgs1HCIsp13msaaoR8dYMhk7hLO.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"The Death Freeze","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Still unsure, Meenakshi starts digging. She starts suspecting that the dead man was somehow linked to a mysterious virus outbreak in the village of Littnong, Eastern Himalayas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kEFJ9o7SJa3QBoqmKN9g8kgfqA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"The Heart of Darkness","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Now convinced that the young man was indeed killed, Meenakshi undertakes a reckless journey to Littnong, seeking to find the killer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yrq6gelsjbU1OkfNjKjHIIxGk8a.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"The Pretender's Bluder","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Meenakshi starts building her theory around the virus. Soon realises that her own life could be under threat.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gU6Bfhj9XfsfB37vkPKpGDzou5l.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"The Hidden Hazard","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A virus starts breaking out around Kolkata. Meenakshi’s investigation picks up speed. A Central Intelligence officer warns Meenakshi to stay away from something that’s way beyond her comprehension.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2XqwvRItXXcVTBG4r0pjwfAmliG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"The Live Data","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kolkata is gripped by the virus outbreak. Meenakshi links the Kolkata virus to the Littnong one. Unknown to her, games are being played by her own accomplices about the identity of the virus. She must go back to Littnong to find some light.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/FMFnT3LahRKV2IWEniplwJCXBw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"The Boat Called Ujaan","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A few earth-shattering breakthroughs stab Meenakshi’s heart. She decides not to continue with her investigation any more only to be brought back to it by her friend. Because now it is not just a man’s death but the need to stop a genocide.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tpbKZPJAMmINzgVWP9L5Z1H6gm0.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9QLUktTWVlbmEtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.8","title":"The Reckless Sister","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When Meenakshi finally cracks her case, she needs to act. And act she does. Most recklessly.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qe2GIpLJ98rIb7yEhcak3M0Xjoa.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"6.5","cast":["Tanya Maniktala","Jisshu Sengupta","Parambrata Chatterjee","Vinay Pathak","Zarina Wahab","Saurav Das","Harsh Chhaya","Vipin Sharma"],"director":["Arindam Mitra"],"released":"2023-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Arindam Mitra","character":"Director"},{"name":"Tanya Maniktala","character":"Meenakshi Iyer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qO1qHiX7ygRG8tWnKqpp0igiJpG.jpg"},{"name":"Jisshu Sengupta","character":"Dr. Andrew Rakshaw","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6Ha4p2iQOHpnKC1uB4NKJ53kHRi.jpg"},{"name":"Parambrata Chatterjee","character":"Subho Roy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/f0vKFvgiyBvdgiXOFKpnnb6AfbG.jpg"},{"name":"Vinay Pathak","character":"Dr. Basu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nt4MvHjHq5sF1aPrLyFO1YizD8y.jpg"},{"name":"Zarina Wahab","character":"Chandana Dey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pPGjjhKIamcwKlxRjwN3r8OPhl5.jpg"},{"name":"Saurav Das","character":"Adi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pmWYgVDeSGiPFiU1eevF7ilWq8b.jpg"},{"name":"Harsh Chhaya","character":"Pritam Sen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1